Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:58:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add version counter, Sergeant Promotions update button,
 member points history

- New sidebar version tag (v18) so you can always confirm whether a deploy actually picked up the latest changes
- Sergeant Promotions tab gets a 'Check for Promotions' button, backed by a new check-sergeant-promotions edge function that queries each candidate's live Roblox group rank (not just the cached DB value) and removes anyone who has actually been promoted, even if they haven't logged back into the site
- Member profile modal (Members page) now shows that person's points history (last 20 transactions, with who awarded them), not just their totals
